/-!
# Every function of LINK rejects a call that carries value

Generated by `scripts/gen_value.py`; do not edit. Lean checks every statement against
`CODE`.

The dispatcher of this code has no check of the value: each function checks CALLVALUE
itself. `value_zero_of_ok`: a run of `CODE` from pc 0 that ends with no error has value 0, for
every selector of the table.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option linter.unusedVariables false
set_option maxRecDepth 4096

namespace LinkVerify.Complete

